			"notes": "First release.\n\nBone meal a sapling, or sneak-place one, and it becomes a full tree instantly — no growth stages, no waiting, no repeated bone meal.\n\n- Works on every vanilla sapling, including the 2x2 mega variants (spruce, jungle, dark oak) and mangrove propagules.\n- No tick function. Detection is advancement-driven, so it costs nothing while you play.\n- Falls back to a clipped placement when there is no room for the tree, so a sapling in a tight spot still grows without destroying your build. Disable with `/scoreboard players set #force insta_grow.config 0`.\n- Ships two ways from the same payload: a data pack zip for `<world>/datapacks/`, and a mod jar that works on both Fabric and NeoForge. The jar is an always-on data pack — no Java, no extra dependencies.\n\nMinecraft 1.21.4 through 26.2. Client or server."
		}
